            "correctAnswer": "Trade and Aids to Trade",
            "explanation": "Commerce is defined as the sum total of all activities involved in the exchange of goods and services, which are broadly categorized into Trade (the actual buying and selling) and Aids to Trade (activities that facilitate this exchange)."
